                        rdfs:comment "Indication of the area in which GPRS can be used for ETCS, expressed as a list of GPRS-enabled RBCs."@en ;
                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/949/> ;
                        rdfs:label "Area of implementation of GPRS"@en ;
                        rdfs:seeAlso "Sections of EIRENE optional for trackside in TSI"@en ;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "stable" ;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Since GPRS can be used for ETCS, indicate in which areas it is implemented (e.g.: whole section, only between two signals, at the stationâ€¦)"@en .


###  http://data.europa.eu/949/gradient
:gradient rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
          rdfs:subPropertyOf :sidingDataParameter ;
          rdf:type owl:FunctionalProperty ;
          rdfs:domain [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
                        owl:unionOf ( :CommonCharacteristicsSubset
